  Board -->|xcld to-mermaid| Docs["Mermaid for docs and PRs"]
  Board -.->|XCLD_AUTO_EXPORT=save| Export[".exports/name.mmd, always current"]
  Versions["Next: a version on every save"]
  Merge["Next: merge on re-import keeps your notes"]
  Board -.-> Versions
  Agent -.-> Merge
